  "note": "Spot list prices per vCPU-hour and per GB-hour of memory (least-squares fits over the standard, highcpu and highmem shapes; T2D and H3 per vCPU with memory included). us-central1 is the live Spot pricing page on 2026-10-02 (it shares Spot prices with us-east1 and us-west1); the other regions are the five cheapest Batch regions per family in the public Cloud Billing Catalog snapshot of 2026-09-24. Prices change daily: `yapnr exp prices` refreshes them from the Billing Catalog. Regions missing here are priced at us-central1 (above the median for most families), and the estimate says so. memory_gb_per_vcpu holds for shapes of 8 vCPUs or more. speed_vs_reference is the PassMark single-thread rating divided by the Apple M4 rating (an estimate until the calibration measures it).",
